        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Deron Miller, Chad I Ginsburg, Jess Margera, Matt Deis\n- Bands: CKY, Violent Femmes\n- Albums: Carver City\n- Places: Milwaukee, Wisconsin, Pennsylvania\n- Genres: folk punk, alternative metal\n\nFacts:\n- Violent Femmes is an American folk punk band from Milwaukee, Wisconsin, and the band was initially active from 1980 to 2009.\n- CKY was formed in 1998 by Deron Miller, Chad I Ginsburg, and Jess Margera.\n- CKY currently features Chad I Ginsburg, Jess Margera, and Matt Deis.\n- Carver City is the fourth studio album by CKY, a Pennsylvania alternative metal band.",
